<title>ITALY: SOCCER-FIORENTINA V BARCELONA TEAMS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-FIORENTINA V BARCELONA TEAMS.</headline>
<dateline>FLORENCE, Italy 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Teams for the European Cup Winners' Cup semifinal second leg between Fiorentina and Barcelona on Thursday:</p>
<p>Fiorentina - 1-Francesco Toldo; 2-Daniele Carnasciale, 3-Michele Serena, 5-Lorenzo Amoruso, 19-Pasquale Padalino, 7-Stefan Schwarz, 14-Sandro Cois, 10-Manuel Rui Costa, 11-Luis Oliveira, 8-Francesco Baiano, 23-Anselmo Robbiati.</p>
<p>Barcelona - 1-Vitor Baia; 2-Albert Ferrer, 12-Sergi Barjuan, 20-Miguel Angel Nadal, 26-Fernando Couto, 21-Luis Enrique, 23-Ivan De La Pena, 4-Josep Guardiola, 7-Luis Figo, 10-Giovanni, 9-Ronaldo.</p>
</text>
